description:
A short, non-interactive hint shown while its trigger is hovered or focused.

  Tooltip do
    TooltipTrigger { |trigger| Button(**trigger, variant: :outline, icon: true, aria_label: "Add to favorites") { Icon(:heart) } }
    TooltipContent { "Add to favorites" }
  end

Opens after the delay (600 ms, or a TooltipProvider's), instantly on keyboard focus; closes on leave, blur, Escape or a click on the trigger. `track_cursor_axis:` (:x, :y, :both) makes it follow the pointer; `disabled: true` suppresses it. A tooltip isn't reachable on touch or by screen readers as a name - give icon-only triggers an aria_label.
